<div class="page">
  <div class="header-box">
    <div>
      <h2>Account Activity</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-container">
      <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
      <div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #A50026;">SU</div>
      <div style="font-size: 12px; text-align: center;">California State University</div>
      <div style="font-size: 10px; text-align: center;">CHANNEL ISLANDS</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <label>View by:</label>
    <select style="padding: 5px;">
      <option>All</option>
    </select>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <label>From:</label>
    <input type="text" value="{{ start_date }}" style="padding: 5px; margin-right: 10px;">
    <label>To:</label>
    <input type="text" value="{{ end_date }}" style="padding: 5px; margin-right: 10px;">
    <select style="padding: 5px; margin-right: 10px;">
      <option>All Terms</option>
    </select>
    <button style="padding: 5px;">Go</button>
  </div>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Transactions</th>
        <th>Posted Date</th>
        <th>Item</th>
        <th>Find</th>
        <th>View All</th>
        <th>Term</th>
        <th>Charge</th>
        <th>Payment</th>
        <th>Refund</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for transaction in transactions %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="transaction.id">{{ transaction.id }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="transaction.posted_date">{{ transaction.posted_date }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="transaction.item_description">{{ transaction.item_description }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="transaction.find_status">{{ transaction.find_status }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="transaction.view_all_status">{{ transaction.view_all_status }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="transaction.term">{{ transaction.term }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="transaction.charge_amount">{{ transaction.charge_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="transaction.payment_amount">{{ transaction.payment_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="transaction.refund_amount">{{ transaction.refund_amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
    <div>
      <p>Currency used is in <span data-field="currency_unit">{{ currency_unit }}</span>.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>First <span data-field="total_transactions_count">{{ total_transactions_count }}</span> Last</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-box">
    <div style="text-align: left;">
      <p>Wednesday, <span data-field="date_1">{{ date_1 }}</span></p>
      <p>Monday, <span data-field="date_2">{{ date_2 }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-container">
      <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
      <div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #A50026;">SU</div>
      <div style="font-size: 12px; text-align: center;">California State University</div>
      <div style="font-size: 10px; text-align: center;">CHANNEL ISLANDS</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h2 style="text-align: center;">FINANCIAL AID AND</h2>
    <h2 style="text-align: center;">OUT-OF-POCKET REFUNDS BEGIN PROCESSING ON</h2>
    <h2 style="text-align: center;">THE FOLLOWING PUBLISHED DATES BELOW AFTER</h2>
    <h2 style="text-align: center;">THE START OF TERM.</h2>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h3 style="color: #A50026;">FINANCIAL AID</h3>
      <p>Refunds begin processing on</p>
      <h3 style="color: #A50026;">{{ financial_aid_start_date }}</h3>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h3 style="color: #A50026;">OUT-OF-POCKET</h3>
      <p>Refunds begin processing on</p>
      <h3 style="color: #A50026;">{{ out_of_pocket_start_date }}</h3>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <h1>How will I receive my refund?</h1>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <h3 style="color: #A50026;">Direct Deposit</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><span style="font-weight: bold;">&#10003;</span> Fastest way to receive your refund. Electronic transfer.</li>
        <li><span style="font-weight: bold;">&#10003;</span> Enroll in Direct Deposit in your myCI portal.</li>
        <li><span style="font-weight: bold;">&#10003;</span> Takes <span data-field="direct_deposit_time">{{ direct_deposit_time }}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: center;">
      <!-- Placeholder Image -->
      <div style="height: 250px; background-color: #eee; border: 1px solid #ccc;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h3 style="color: #A50026;">Paper Check</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><span style="font-weight: bold;">&#10003;</span> Checks will be mailed to the mailing address on file.</li>
      <li><span style="font-weight: bold;">&#10003;</span> Automatically refunded as check if not enrolled in Direct Deposit</li>
      <li><span style="font-weight: bold;">&#10003;</span> Please allow <span data-field="paper_check_processing_time">{{ paper_check_processing_time }}</span> for processing</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <h1>How to enroll in direct deposit in your myCI student portal</h1>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <ol>
        <li>In the Student Finances section, on the left-hand side of the page, you will see the "Enroll in Direct Deposit" link. Select the link.</li>
        <li>You will be required to complete three fields: bank routing number, bank account number and account type.</li>
        <li>For checking information, the bank routing number and the bank account number can be found on the bottom of your paper checks.</li>
        <li><span style="color: red;">*Caution:</span> Please do not enter the number on your debit card - this is not your account number.</li>
        <li>For savings information, please contact your bank to determine the bank routing number and bank account number.</li>
        <li>Read and agree to the terms and conditions, then select "Submit". Your next refund will be processed using direct deposit.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <!-- Placeholder Image -->
      <div style="height: 350px; background-color: #eee; border: 1px solid #ccc;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <h1>How will I get reimbursed for the out-of-pocket payments I made once financial aid applies to my student account?</h1>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-weight: bold;">REFUNDS GO BACK TO ORIGINAL PAYMENT SOURCE</h2>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <ul>
        <li><span style="font-weight: bold;">&#10003;</span> Refunds for credit/debit card payments will be refunded back to the card that was used. Credit card payments are transacted in your myCI portal via the Cashnet payment system within the student portal. (<span data-field="credit_card_fee_rate">{{ credit_card_fee_rate }}</span>)</li>
        <li><span style="font-weight: bold;">&#10003;</span> Cash and Electronic Check payments are a free payment option in myCI portal and will be refunded back as a paper check- unless you've enrolled in direct deposit. Then it will automatically be refunded as direct deposit.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: center;">
      <!-- Placeholder Image -->
      <div style="height: 250px; background-color: #eee; border: 1px solid #ccc;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <h1>How can I contact Student Business Services?</h1>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #A50026;">&#9679; Contact Us:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Sage Hall, Enrollment Center</li>
          <li>Phone: (<span data-field="phone_area_code">{{ phone_area_code }}</span>) <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></li>
          <li>Phone Hours: Mon. – Fri. <span data-field="phone_hours">{{ phone_hours }}</span></li>
          <li>Cashier Window Hours: Mon. – Fri. <span data-field="cashier_hours">{{ cashier_hours }}</span></li>
          <li>Email: <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #A50026;">&#9679; Resources:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Website: <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span></li>
          <li>"How to" PDF documents</li>
          <li>Important updates</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <!-- Placeholder Image -->
      <div style="height: 350px; background-color: #eee; border: 1px solid #ccc;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

